        <activityName xml:lang="en">Process specific emissions and resources, from uranium milling, open pit mine</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Process specific emissions and resources, from uranium milling, open pit mine
PSI data (BFE project 407, Christian Bauer, April 2012).;
UUID: b999f5b7-96f9-3c3b-9c03-30a9a1c2d03e
The module includes: diesel use for digging and producing electricity; transport of the diesel fuel; radioactive and non-radioactive emissions to air and water; water use (mining water, but attributed to "unspecified natural origin").
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average conditions in early 1980s.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b999f5b7-96f9-3c3b-9c03-30a9a1c2d03e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
